) SOC Teams</h3><p>AI isn’t replacing SOC analysts, it’s transforming them into “super analysts.” By automating repetitive tasks, AI enables teams to focus on high-impact investigations, strategy, and smarter threat response.</p></div><div class=\"featured_details is-small\"><div class=\"news_company-wrapper\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69b7be4175500d9e40b6765a/69bbe8fac39767f41a9504f3_6926c2eb2ce608abed20f5a0_dana-rozen.avif\" class=\"news_logo\"><div class=\"text-weight-bold\">Dana Rozen</div></div><div class=\"news_details-inner\"><div>December 1, 2025</div><div class=\"icon-small is-news w-embed\"></div></div></div></a>","link":"https://mate.security/labs/ai-empowering-soc-teams","retrieved":1764547200000},{"title":"The Rise of the Hybrid Workforce: How Humans and Machines Are Resetting the Business Dynamic","contents":"<a href=\"/labs/rise-of-the-hybrid-workforce-humans-and-machines\" class=\"news_collection-item-inner\"><div class=\"news_heading\"><div class=\"news_image-wrapper\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69b7be4175500d9e40b6765a/69bc05d7b0d28f6c515b9d5b_693970d2f56458b7d33bfdfc_things-i-learned-about-security-from-soccer.avif\" class=\"news_image\"></div><h3 class=\"h4-style text-style-2lines\">The Rise of the Hybrid Workforce: How Humans and Machines Are Resetting the Business Dynamic</h3><p>Human–AI collaboration is transforming every business function, creating hybrid workforces that innovate faster, make better decisions, and outperform traditional teams.</p></div><div class=\"featured_details is-small\"><div class=\"news_company-wrapper\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69b7be4175500d9e40b6765a/69bbe8fa55820c89d9131c6c_691ddcf19d14ac2e7be6cb1a_asaf-wiener.avif\" class=\"news_logo\"><div class=\"text-weight-bold\">Asaf Wiener</div></div><div class=\"news_details-inner\"><div>December 10, 2025</div><div class=\"icon-small is-news w-embed\"></div></div></div></a>","link":"https